exports[`l'e-mail « Votre guide » — références (sujet, HTML, texte) > desabonne · en > sujet 1`] = `"Your enterprise AI guide (PDF, 40 pages)"`;

exports[`l'e-mail « Votre guide » — références (sujet, HTML, texte) > desabonne · en > texte 1`] = `
" 

https://axion-ia.com

The end-to-end AI partner for SMEs


YOUR ENTERPRISE AI GUIDE

Here is the guide you requested: 40 pages, in French, on concrete uses of AI in business, real costs, return on investment, governance and pitfalls to avoid.

Start with page 5: the essentials on one page.

Download the guide (PDF)  → https://axion-ia.com/api/guide-ia/telecharger?t=dddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddd

Axion-IA's letter

You had left Axion-IA's letter. To receive it again (1 to 2 emails a month, only when there is something new and useful), confirm with one click; without it, nothing changes.

Receive the letter again https://axion-ia.com/en/confirmation/newsletter?token=cccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccc

Didn't request this? Just ignore this message: you will receive nothing else.

A question? Just reply to this email — it reaches us directly, and a human reads it.

The Axion-IA team
Hearing about AI everywhere and no longer sure where to start? We cut through the noise, and handle it for you, end to end.
AI audit · Automated systems implementation · Training · 1-to-1 coaching
Book a call https://axion-ia.com/fr/appel?depuis=email&utm_source=email&utm_medium=cycle&utm_content=signature · LinkedIn https://www.linkedin.com/company/axion-ia-france

AXION IA SAS · French company (SAS)
11 Avenue Paul Verlaine, ELITE BUREAUX - boîte 53, 38100 Grenoble, France
Reg. no. 108018631 · VAT FR51108018631 · Training provider reg. no. 84381100438
Cet enregistrement ne vaut pas agrément de l'État.
Contact: contact@axion-ia.com
© 2026 AXION IA SAS — All rights reserved.
Stop receiving commercial messages from Axion-IA https://axion-ia.com/api/unsubscribe?token=<JETON-SIGNE>"
`;

