exports[`l'e-mail « Votre guide » — références (sujet, HTML, texte) > inscrit-lettre · en > texte 1`] = `
" 

https://axion-ia.com

The end-to-end AI partner for SMEs


YOUR ENTERPRISE AI GUIDE

Here is the guide you requested: 40 pages, in French, on concrete uses of AI in business, real costs, return on investment, governance and pitfalls to avoid.

Start with page 5: the essentials on one page.

Download the guide (PDF)  → https://axion-ia.com/api/guide-ia/telecharger?t=dddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddd

Axion-IA's letter

You will also receive Axion-IA's letter. 1 to 2 emails a month, only when there is something new and useful. If you do not want it, one click is enough: Unsubscribe from the letter https://axion-ia.com/en/desabonnement?token=uuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuu

Didn't request this? Click "Unsubscribe from the letter" above: you will receive nothing else.

